      "value": "@{62df06d982494544a256cd1b|full_name} \"On every other layer, you should not be using material animations, shader property animations, or blend shape animations, because they aren't copied to your mirror clone\", additionally if you were using tools like VRCFury they worked around some of these mistakes for you in some cases.",
